node_modules/
# All generated from ../art and src/ by the tools in this folder. Regenerating
# is one command and costs a second; keeping a 1.4MB binary in history that
# churns on every art change is not worth the saved step.
# The icons are generated too, but by arithmetic rather than from ../art, and
# they are 150kB that changes only when the mark does. Kept, so a deploy from
# a fresh clone does not need a build step nobody remembers.
public/atlas.png
public/atlas.json
public/manifest.json
public/bundle.js
public/bundle.js.map
# The smoke tests' screenshots. Paths in here are relative to this folder, so
# it is proving.png, not phaser/proving.png.
#
# Eight of these were tracked and seven were ignored, for no reason anyone
# could have reconstructed -- so half of them churned a binary into every
# commit that ran a suite, and the other half did not. Nothing references any
# of them, and every one is written by the suite that names it, so they are
# all generated output now and none of them are kept.
proving.png
playable.png
fight.png
loop.png
